From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Leonid <leonidy.1985@yandex.ru>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 11:42:22 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] power: supply: mt6370: power_supply_config lost of_node

The battery psy is registered without a firmware node; clear fwnode,
which is what replaced of_node in struct power_supply_config.
---
 drivers/power/supply/mt6370-charger.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/power/supply/mt6370-charger.c b/drivers/power/supply/mt6370-charger.c
index 5b3d71f0c..e6f500e24 100644
--- a/drivers/power/supply/mt6370-charger.c
+++ b/drivers/power/supply/mt6370-charger.c
@@ -848,7 +848,7 @@ static int mt6370_chg_init_psy(struct mt6370_priv *priv)
 	if (IS_ERR(priv->psy))
 		return PTR_ERR(priv->psy);
 
-	cfg.of_node = NULL;
+	cfg.fwnode = NULL;
 	bat = devm_power_supply_register(priv->dev, &mt6370_bat_psy_desc, &cfg);
 	if (IS_ERR(bat))
 		dev_warn(priv->dev, "no battery supply: %ld\n", PTR_ERR(bat));
